  "releaseNotes": "Changed OrderingConstraints.VisitBefore and VisitAfter to be an array or RouteNode instead of a single RouteNode reference.\n\nIf you used it in previous versions,  just make an array instead of the single reference:\nA.OrderingConstraints.VisitBefore = B;\nchange to\nA.OrderingConstraints.VisitBefore = new RouteNode[] { B };\nor if using newer C# compilers\nA.OrderingConstraints.VisitBefore = [ B ];\n\nObviously you can also (unlike previous versions) use several stops as visit before or after.",
